{
  "job_B8.4.3.2_20251003_114848": {
    "chunk_text": "\ufffdam men \u00fee forscruncene hand h\u00e6fde, aris gemang him. \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 he alyf\u00f0 restedagum wel to donne hwe\u00feer \u00f0e yfele, sawla geh\u00e6lan, hwe\u00feer \u00f0e forspillan; & hi & hi besceawiende mid yrre ofer hyra heortan blindnesse geunret cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00feam men, A\u00feene \u00feine hand; \u00dea Pharisei mid Herodianiscum utgangende \u00feeahtedon ongen hine, hu hi hine fordon mihton. & \u00fea ferde se H\u00e6lend to \u00fe\u00e6re s\u00e6 mid his leorningcnihton, & mycel menigeo him fyligde fram Galilea, & Hierusalem, & fram Iudea & begeondan Iordane, & to him com mycel menegeo ymbe Tirum & & he cw\u00e6\u00f0 to his cnihtum \u00fe\u00e6t hi him on scipe \u00feenodon, for \u00fe\u00e6re menigu \u00fe\u00e6t hi hine ne of\u00ferungon. So\u00felice manega he geh\u00e6lde, swa \u00fe\u00e6t hi \u00e6thrinon his, & swa fela swa untrumnessa. & uncl\u00e6ne gastas h\u00e6fdon; \u00fea hi hine gesawon, hi toforan him astrehton, & \u00feus cwe\u00f0ende clypedon, & he him swy\u00f0e forbead, \u00fe\u00e6t hi hine ne geswutelodon. & on anne munt he ferde & to him geclypode \u00fea \u00f0e he wolde & hi to him comon. & he dyde \u00fe\u00e6t hi twelfe mid him w\u00e6ron, & he hi asende godspell to bodigenne. & he him anweald sealde untrumnessa to h\u00e6lanne, & deofolseocnessa ut to adrifanne. & he nemde Simon Petrum. & Iacobum Zebedei, & Iohannem his bro\u00f0or, & him naman onsette Boaneries, \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00f0",
